      ITD GrowthLabs runs full-funnel performance marketing for Jewelry (Fine + Fashion + Bridal + Gold-plated) brands across India, GCC, and UK. Meta + Instagram + Reels + Google + Shopping + Performance Max + TikTok + Snapchat + WhatsApp CTWA + creator + influencer + LTV/CAC/cohort attribution. Grounded in Rs 8+ Cr annual managed ad spend across 100+ B2C brands and published case studies including Bewakoof, Snitch, Libas, Kama Ayurveda, Plum, Sugar, WOW Skin Science, Fabelia + 50-piece D2C content clusters for skincare + jewelry + fashion.
