    <div class="itdgl-pm-list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="itdgl-pm-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-pm-q">How does Meta + Instagram Ads work for a jewelry brand in Bengaluru?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-pm-a">Meta Ads (Facebook + Instagram + Reels) is your #1 paid channel for a jewelry brand in Bengaluru, typically 40-50% of ad spend. Core stack: (1) Advantage+ Shopping (AAS) — Meta's automated campaign, feeds catalog + creative + audience signals, drives 3-6x ROAS. (2) Catalog Sales dynamic product ads for retargeting + prospecting. (3) Reels + short video (35-45% of creative mix, highest algorithmic priority). (4) Creator UGC content whitelisted via Meta Branded Content Partner. (5) WhatsApp CTWA (Click-to-WhatsApp) ads. (6) Meta CAPI (Conversion API) recovers 15-30% attribution lost to iOS 14+. (7) LTV-weighted value-based bidding. In Bengaluru, Bengaluru buyer LTV/CAC-driven + tech-savvy + Shopify + headless architecture + high subscription adoption</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-pm-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-pm-q">What CPL should we expect on Meta Ads for a jewelry brand in Bengaluru?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-pm-a">In INR: Rs 200-2,500 (India), AED 15-200 (GCC), £8-120 (UK) depending on tier. Range depends on sub-vertical + AOV + creative quality + audience quality + brand-recall level. Peak season (Wedding + Akshaya Tritiya + Dhanteras + Diwali (India), Ramadan + Eid + Dubai Shopping Festival (GCC), Christmas + Valentine's Day + Mother's Day (UK)) CPL rises 30-60% but conversion rate + AOV lifts 30-50% — net ROAS stays flat or improves. Off-peak CPL 20-30% lower + higher share of experimental testing budget. Creator UGC in retargeting drops CPL 30-50% vs studio content. Effective cost per acquired customer = CPL / conversion rate. In Bengaluru, India's tech + startup capital + VC-backed D2C founders + SaaS + fintech + product/engineering leaders + design + tech-native buyer</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-pm-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-pm-q">What creative velocity + format mix for Meta Ads for a jewelry brand?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-pm-a">Boutique tier: 4-8 creative units/week. Growth tier: 15-30/week. Enterprise tier: 30-80/week (fast-fashion + streetwear + high-drop-frequency categories). Below velocity, CPL climbs 25-50% within 60 days from creative fatigue. Format mix: Reels + short video 35-45% (highest engagement + Meta priority), carousel product + collection 20-25%, single image lifestyle 10-15%, creator UGC + testimonial 15-20% (highest CTR + lowest CPL on retargeting), static product with overlay 5-10%, long-form video (60-90 sec) 5%. For Jewelry in Bengaluru, video-first creative outperforms static 3-5x.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-pm-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-pm-q">How much monthly Meta ad budget should we spend?</h2>
